  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.10.3">
<l>ellaiyil vācal kuṟukac ceṉṟāl</l>
<l rend="indent">eṟṟina maṉtamar paṟṟum pōtu</l>
<l>nillumi ṉeṉṉu mupāya millai</l>
<l rend="indent">nēmiyuñ caṅkamu mēnti ṉāṉē</l>
<l>collalām pōtēyuṉ nāma mellām</l>
<l rend="indent">colliṉē ṉeṉṉaik kuṟikkoṇ ṭeṉṟum</l>
<l>allal paṭāvaṇṇaṅ kākka vēṇṭum</l>
<l rend="indent">araṅkat taravaṇaip paḷḷi yāṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>O Bearer of the discus and conch,</l>
<l rend="indent">when, if [I] have reached the entrance to [his] border,</l>
<l rend="indent">Yama’s attendants grab and abuse [me],</l>
<l rend="indent">there will be no way to say “Stop!”</l>
<l>Whenever [I] could speak, I spoke all your names,</l>
<l rend="indent">take [this as] an indication of my [devotion].</l>
<l>Sleeper on the serpent bed in Araṅkam,</l>
<l rend="indent">[I] need [you] to protect [me], such that [I] do not suffer!</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
